  "goodToKnow": "Der Aufkleber is a sticker: einen Aufkleber aufkleben. Many German mailboxes have a Bitte keine Werbung sticker to stop junk mail, which carriers must respect. Cars on the Autobahn may need an Umweltplakette (emissions sticker) to enter city centres, and Austria and Switzerland require a Vignette (toll sticker). Der Sticker is the casual synonym. From aufkleben (to stick on), and kleben (to stick, glue). Plural: die Aufkleber."
